 * {@link DuplicateHouseholdException}. Two owners sharing a household (same lastName and
 * postcode) but differing in telephone or email are therefore <em>not</em> a hard duplicate:
 * they may coexist as household members and are instead soft-flagged downstream by
 * {@link AssignPossibleDuplicate}.
